"This contract has invoices, so its lines can no longer be added, deleted or "
"have their terms changed: a new contract must be created. Their accounting "
"dimensions, comments and tags can still be edited, and the price or quantity "
"of a recurring or usage-based line can be changed from a date with its Amend "
"button."
